  {
    "name": "recall",
    "title": "Recall",
    "description": "Recall memories, or omit query for recent activity; since/source filter raw evidence. memory_since (inclusive) and memory_until (exclusive) filter stored memories, with or without a query, by the latest original source time of their current evidence; unknown dates are excluded. Resolve relative periods to aware timestamps.\n\nWhen choosing how to carry out a task and automatic context is insufficient, consult relevant prior experiences.",
